.TH ORO-PLATFORM 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro\-platform \- compile\-time platform and architecture feature macros
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <oro/platform.h>
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The oro/platform.h header defines the compile\-time platform, operating system, and architecture macros used by the public runtime and extension APIs.
.PP
Use these macros to gate source compatibility for desktop, mobile, Apple, Windows, Unix, and cross\-compiled targets without duplicating platform detection logic.
.SH MACROS
.TP
\fBORO_RUNTIME_PLATFORM\fR
.nf
#define ORO_RUNTIME_PLATFORM 1
.fi
.PP
Public macro declared in oro/platform.h.
.TP
\fBORO_RUNTIME_PLATFORM_WASM\fR
.nf
#define ORO_RUNTIME_PLATFORM_WASM 0
.fi
.PP
when this header is included, this is always `0`
.TP
